        <main class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-10 text-[14px] leading-7 text-slate-600">
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. No sensitive data collected</h2><p class="mt-3">ScoreUp does NOT collect SSN, bank account numbers, or credit card numbers. Our calculators run 100% in your browser — no data sent to server. We are not a bank, lender, or credit bureau.</p><div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800"><b>What we DON'T collect:</b> SSN, credit scores, bank logins, income, address. Our tools estimate, not pull your report.</div></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">2. What we do collect</h2><ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2"><li><b>Cookies for ads:</b> Google AdSense may use cookies to show relevant ads. You can disable in browser.</li><li><b>Analytics:</b> Anonymous page views via Google Analytics (no personal data).</li><li><b>Contact form:</b> If you email us, we store email to reply (deleted after 90 days).</li></ul></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">3. Affiliate links</h2><p class="mt-3">When you click to Self, Chime, Kikoff, we may earn commission. Links have rel="sponsored". Clicking does not share your data with us — you go directly to official site (self.inc, chime.com, etc.). See <a href="/Pages/About#how-we-make-money" class="underline font-bold text-slate-900">How we make money</a>.</p></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">4. Your rights</h2><p class="mt-3">Email us at wandilecele28@gmail.com to delete any contact data. For California (CCPA): we do not sell personal data.</p></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">5. Contact</h2><p class="mt-3">Questions? <a href="/Pages/Contact" class="underline font-bold text-slate-900">Contact us</a> or email wandilecele28@gmail.com. Response within 24h.</p></section>
